<!-- 10. FAQ -->
<section class="sec faq ground-white" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
    <h2>Questions kratom users ask before switching.</h2>
    <div class="faq__list">
      <details data-open-desktop><summary>Is it tested?</summary><p>Every batch is independently tested for identity, mitragynine potency, heavy metals, and microbials. The batch number on the pouch links to the report for that batch.</p>
        <details class="coa coa--light">
          <summary>Read this batch’s report<span class="coa__ref">Batch RD8221-B</span></summary>
          <div class="coa__doc"><img src="{{ 'dandy-coa-rd8221b-p1.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Page one of the potency report for batch RD8221-B" width="1020" height="1320" loading="lazy"></div>
        </details></details>
      <details><summary>How much is in one gummy?</summary><p>Each gummy contains 35&nbsp;mg of mitragynine. Each pouch contains 30 gummies, and the amount is printed on the pouch.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Why does Dandy taste different?</summary><p>Dandy uses a nano&#8209;emulsion process that breaks the kratom into far smaller particles and blends them with the mixed&#8209;berry flavor through the whole gummy. There is no bitter center to bite through, and those smaller particles are the same reason the gummy hits faster and feels cleaner than powder.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What if I don’t like the flavor?</summary><p>Dandy has a 30&#8209;day money&#8209;back guarantee. If you do not get on with the flavor, email <a href="mailto:support@foreverdandy.com">support@foreverdandy.com</a> within 30 days and we will refund your purchase.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Which states do you ship to?</summary><p>We ship to 34 states. <a href="/pages/contact?view=dandy2-shipping">The full list is here</a>, and checkout confirms your address before payment.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Is 35 mg the same as my usual scoop of powder?</summary><p>No. Powder varies from batch to batch and from scoop to scoop, so you never know exactly how much you are taking. Every Dandy gummy carries 35&nbsp;mg of mitragynine, the same in every gummy and every pouch, and the amount is printed on the label.</p></details>
      <details data-open-desktop><summary>Is there 7&#8209;OH in this?</summary><p>No. There is no 7&#8209;OH in Dandy gummies. 7&#8209;OH is a synthetic kratom derivative, and it is federally illegal. Every Dandy product is made from natural leaf kratom extract.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I become dependent on kratom?</summary><p>Regular daily use can build tolerance and habit. Use the label amount, take breaks, and do not exceed the label.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Will I fail a drug test?</summary><p>Kratom’s alkaloids are not included on standard panels, but specialized tests exist. If testing matters, Dandy cannot guarantee a negative result.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

